# Track ONLY the deployable portal. Everything else stays local.
# This protects answer keys, per-JMO analysis, and study plans from ever
# reaching GitHub/Vercel.

# Ignore everything by default...
*

# ...then un-ignore only what the public app needs.
!index.html
!.gitignore

# COVERAGE.md is not part of the deployed app, but we back it up in git
# so it survives a machine change or folder wipe.
!COVERAGE.md

# PWA shell — needed for install-to-home-screen and offline use.
!manifest.webmanifest
!sw.js
!icons/
!icons/*.png

# Access gate — runs on Vercel's edge before any file is served.
!middleware.js
!package.json
